Constellation OS -- ThinkPad 770ED
==================================

  fetch        mark + a one-screen summary of this machine
  hwcheck      hardware self-check (PCI / PCMCIA / fb / sound / APM)
  x            start Xorg + JWM on VT2 (VT1 keeps the text console)

  wifi         scan for access points
  wifi connect "SSID" "passphrase"     (WPA/WPA2, via wpa_supplicant)
  wifi status
  mountusb     mount a USB stick on /media/usb   (mountusb -u to unmount)
  apm          battery / AC status from /proc/apm
  mixer        volume control (OSS mixer)

  tcc file.c -o file      C compiler (Tiny C Compiler, no SSE)
  make                    GNU make
  vi file                 editor;  q:  :w  :q  :q!

Everything here is ASCII-only: the VGA text console has no CJK font, so
Chinese text would render as garbage.

Card layout: p1 FAT16 boot (grub4dos) / p2 swap / p3 ext4 root.
